8BfhgEdiFJwRD_dLTXXvYDtE&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad6-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQM2IRUC80d6WxEOfNi0fOXr2plVnmZpB47dG-vTMhRBTw&oe=6AD235A0"}, "display_name": "SkydiveSim", "keywords": [], "long_description": "SkydiveSim brings the thrill of skydiving and BASE jumping to your Oculus Quest headset. No more waiting on weather on bad weather days. Put on your headset and choose from our gorgeous levels. Jump from a plane 10,000 feet above ground. Challenge yourself to go through the free fall rings. Then pull your ripcord and fly under the canopy and finally work on your accuracy and  land on the target. You don't need a plane ride back up, just repeat in the same scene or choose another one of our exotics environments to jump into.\nWant even more  excitement? BASE jump from top of the buildings, windmills and light towers, pull the ripcord and navigate to the ground!", "short_description": "SkydiveSim brings the thrill of skydiving and BASE jumping to your Oculus Quest headset.\nThis is the full version of the game and it includes extra environments and well as the ability to jump from a helicopter,  balloon as well as BASE jumping from windmills and light towers!"}]}, "developer_name": null, "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://www.privacypolicies.com/privacy/view/130ff4c1b0687c52ebc5095cc923e4f6", "developer_terms_of_service_url": "https://www.privacypolicies.com/terms/view/37b5278e52fb6c7b0e5aee1fbc17d2b2", "publisher_name": "AV1 Productions", "support_website_url": null, "website_url": "https://www.skydivesim.com/", "category": "GAMES", "comfort_rating": "NOT_RATED", "comfort_tags": [], "context_category": {"id": "2743326035925534", "context_category": "GAMES"}, "context_topics": [{"id": "331529188132278"}], "external_subscription_type": "NOT_REQUIRED", "genres": ["FLYING", "SIMULATION", "ACTION"], "has_in_app_ads": null, "internet_connection": "NOT_REQUIRED", "play_area": "MOVEMENT", "recommended_graphics": null, "recommended_memory_gb": null, "recommended_processor": null, "supported_in_app_languages": ["en"], "supported_input_devices": ["OCULUS_TOUCH"], "supported_player_modes": ["SITTING", "STANDING", "ROOM_SCALE"], "supported_tracking_modes": [], "user_interaction_modes": ["SINGLE_USER"], "id": "452790896554314"}}]}, "scheduled_offers": {"count": 19, "nodes": [{"status": "PUBLISHED", "id": "1055103313795513"}, {"status": "PUBLISHED", "id": "1367317508695363"}, {"status": "PUBLISHED", "id": "1897940734236381"}, {"status": "PUBLISHED", "id": "1335957508440501"}, {"status": "PUBLISHED", "id": "1454593749484301"}, {"status": "PUBLISHED", "id": "911946071676503"}, {"status": "PUBLISHED", "id": "4386253488365143"}, {"status": "PUBLISHED", "id": "850044404609302"}, {"status": "PUBLISHED", "id": "1171582327990692"}, {"status": "PUBLISHED", "id": "705789479199257"}, {"status": "PUBLISHED", "id": "758359823361270"}, {"status": "PUBLISHED", "id": "1407005983906431"}, {"status": "PUBLISHED", "id": "1167867321804748"}, {"status": "PUBLISHED", "id": "1797117851064646"}, {"status": "PUBLISHED", "id": "558672247163105"}, {"status": "PUBLISHED", "id": "1561625437787896"}, {"status": "PUBLISHED", "id": "661102699417392"}, {"status": "PUBLISHED", "id": "1213129326298038"}, {"status": "PUBLISHED", "id": "367175005230199"}]}, "baseline_offer": {"id": "1407005983906431"}, "is_approved": true, "firstOffer": {"nodes": [{"start_time": 1790096400, "status": "PUBLISHED", "id": "1055103313795513"}]}, "liveChannel": {"nodes": [{"latest_supported_binary": {"__typename": "AndroidBinary", "binary_test_results": {"nodes": []}, "id": "26987254250972907", "version": "5.1.0"}, "id": "337947788184196", "channel_name": "LIVE"}]}, "is_for_oculus_keys_only": false, "primary_binaries": {"nodes": [{"__typename": "AndroidBinary", "__isAppBinary": "AndroidBinary", "binary_application": {"__typename": "Application", "id": "3711951435596517", "is_concept": false, "latest_released_binary": {"__typename": "AndroidBinary", "id": "26987254250972907"}, "release_status": "RELEASED"}, "binary_release_channels": {"nodes": [{"channel_name": "LIVE", "id": "337947788184196"}]}, "change_log": "Experience Google Earth locations and Cesium challenges in a whole new light!\n\n- Day and night skies: Enjoy golden dawns, orange sunsets, starry nights, and gentle auroras near the polar regions.\n\n- Night lighting: Stylized building and road lights bring locations to life after dark.\n\n- Time controls: Find Time of Day under Options, beneath Audio. Choose Auto for the location\u2019s local time or set your own. Your settings are saved.\n\n- Multiplayer: Everyone shares the host\u2019s selected time. Update both players\u2019 apps and create a new room.\n\nAuroras and city lights are artistic effects. Quest performance and multiplayer support are still being tested.", "created_date": 1791145851, "id": "26987254250972907", "version": "5.1.0", "version_code": 250, "release_status": "RELEASED", "status": "APPROVED", "binary_test_results": {"nodes": []}, "obb_binary": {"id": "26987207794310886"}, "asset_files": {"count": 0}, "debug_symbols": {"count": 0}, "__isAppBinaryWithFileAsset": "AndroidBinary"}, {"__typename": "AndroidBinary", "__isAppBinary": "AndroidBinary", "binary_application": {"__typename": "Application", "id": "3711951435596517", "is_concept": false, "latest_released_binary": {"__typename": "AndroidBinary", "id": "26987254250972907"}, "release_status": "RELEASED"}, "binary_release_channels": {"nodes": [{"channel_name": "LIVE", "id": "337947788184196"}]}, "change_log": "Halloween has landed in Skydive Sim! Share the skies with skeleton skydivers and a flying witch, enjoy smoother gameplay on Quest, and give your gear a fresh look.\n\n- **Halloween fun:** New seasonal characters, with an option to turn seasonal effects off.\n- **Customize your jump:** New canopy and parachute gear styles, wingsuit designs, and more ways to personalize your look.\n- **More variety in the skies:** AI skydivers now feature custom characters with different looks and colorful matching parachutes and gear.\n- **Smoother movement:** Smooth VR turning is now enabled by default, with better body alignment as you walk, jump, fly your canopy, or explore by jetpack.\n- **Performance and fixes:** Reduced Quest stuttering, improved multiplayer compatibility checks, and other stability improvements.\n\nThe World Is Yours!", "created_date": 1790806139, "id": "26939758772389122", "version": "5.0.9", "version_code": 249, "release_status": "RELEASED", "status": "APPROVED", "binary_test_results": {"nodes": []}, "obb_binary": {"id": "26939722729059393"}, "asset_files": {"count": 0}, "debug_symbols": {"count": 0}, "__isAppBinaryWithFileAsset": "AndroidBinary"}, {"__typename": "AndroidBinary", "__isAppBinary": "AndroidBinary", "binary_application": {"__typename": "Application", "id": "3711951435596517", "is_concept": false, "latest_released_binary": {"__typename": "AndroidBinary", "id": "26987254250972907"}, "release_status": "RELEASED"}, "binary_release_channels": {"nodes": [{"channel_name": "LIVE", "id": "337947788184196"}]}, "change_log": "Minor bug fixes and improved performance", "created_date": 1790446676, "id": "26892050373826629", "version": "5.0.8", "version_code": 248, "release_status": "RELEASED", "status": "APPROVED", "binary_test_results": {"nodes": []}, "obb_binary": {"id": "26892009033830763"}, "asset_files": {"count": 0}, "debug_symbols": {"count": 0}, "__isAppBinaryWithFileAsset": "AndroidBinary"}, {"__typename": "AndroidBinary", "__isAppBinary": "AndroidBinary", "binary_application": {"__typename": "Application", "id": "3711951435596517", "is_concept": false, "latest_released_binary": {"__typename": "AndroidBinary", "id": "26987254250972907"}, "release_status": "RELEASED"}, "binary_release_channels": {"nodes": [{"channel_name": "LIVE", "id": "337947788184196"}]}, "change_log": "Minor bug fixes and improvements", "created_date": 1790189517, "id": "26854307680934232", "version": "5.0.7", "version_code": 247